{"id": "UgxuT75LyJEHr3QCyjB4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 4, "text": "I am 61 years old and have maintained the same weight, a way too much. I practice Tai Chi from May though not regularly now. Don't see any results. Eat three times a day. Below normal calories level needed.  I love that calm, traditional chinese music, and respect their traditional medicine knowledge but I only feel better for a short time after exercising. I used to train hard at the gym, walk a lot, swim, and work out. However, nothing has helped since I turned 47. My medical results are O'K.  and I am Happy.", "published": "2026-08-03T10:46:47", "replies": 1, "creator": false}
